{"title":"2023 AIME II","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>2023 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Invitational_Mathematics_Examination\" title=\"American Invitational Mathematics Examination\">AIME</a> II</b> problems and solutions. The test was held on Wednesday February 15, 2023. The first link contains the full set of test problems. The rest contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems\">Entire Test</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2023 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2023 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">Pro